WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
[Starting on the lawn next to a large white building with a curved roof]

00:01:00.000 --> 00:02:00.000
[Walking past a playground and a rock water feature beside the path]

00:02:00.000 --> 00:03:00.000
[A wide sealed path along the edge of the lake. Ducks are swimming near the rocks]

00:03:00.000 --> 00:05:00.000
[Big trees and open lawn, with the lake and houses on the other side of the water]

00:05:00.000 --> 00:08:00.000
[The path goes between tall trees, flax and native grasses]

00:08:00.000 --> 00:11:00.000
[Following the path through thick native planting, with other walkers ahead]

00:11:00.000 --> 00:13:00.000
[Houses across the water, and the path curving between tall grasses]

00:13:00.000 --> 00:15:00.000
[The lake shows through the flax, with cabbage trees against the sky]

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:56.000
[A grassy area with a bench near the end of the walk]
